# Python Programming Lab

This repository contains the Python Programming Lab experiments covering **Object-Oriented Programming, Functional Programming, Generators, Decorators, Multithreading, Multiprocessing, AsyncIO, Exception Handling, NumPy, and Pandas**.

## Experiments

| Experiment | Title                                                         | Main Concepts                                                  |
| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 1          | Zomato Food Delivery Management System                        | Classes, Objects, Inheritance, OOP                             |
| 2          | SBI YONO Digital Banking System                               | Encapsulation, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Operator Overloading |
| 3          | Zoomcar Vehicle Rental System                                 | Class Hierarchy, Inheritance, Special Methods                  |
| 4          | Amazon Customer Purchase Analytics                            | Lambda, map(), filter(), reduce()                              |
| 5          | BESCOM Electricity Consumption System                         | Generators, Iterators, yield                                   |
| 6          | Google Fit Activity Monitoring System                         | Decorators, Closures, Higher-Order Functions                   |
| 7          | IDM Multi-File Download Manager                               | Multithreading, Thread Synchronization                         |
| 8          | Zoho Payroll Processing System                                | Multiprocessing, AsyncIO, async/await                          |
| 9          | NPTEL Online Examination System                               | Exception Handling, Logging, Assertions, tracemalloc           |
| 10         | Google Maps Smart Traffic Data Analytics                      | NumPy Arrays, Vectorization, Statistical Functions             |
| 11         | Naukri Candidate Registration Validation and Reporting System | Pandas, Data Cleaning, Data Aggregation                        |

---

# Experiment 1 – Zomato Food Delivery Management System

## Problem Statement

Develop a Zomato-like Food Delivery Management System using Python Object-Oriented Programming concepts.

## Concepts Used

* Classes and Objects
* Inheritance
* Encapsulation
* Polymorphism
* Object-Oriented Programming

## Main Features

* Manage customer information.
* Manage restaurant details.
* Manage food orders.
* Calculate order amounts.
* Display order details.

